BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 211.97 Tm (Action: Remove the default route, pin a static host route to the remote tunnel endpoint via the ISP, and bring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 196.75 Tm (up the tunnel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 181.52 Tm (Detail: Delete the default route, add a static route to the remote router's public IP out of the ISP interface,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 166.30 Tm (then set tunnel source G1, the remote destination, and path MTU discovery; no IPSec is needed for public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.07 Tm (transit [Null0 Labs - Pr9psxw4Z_o @ 00:14:32]) Tj ET
