BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Labs - Pr9psxw4Z_o @ 00:26:29]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Step: 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Title: Cut over to a public ASN and your own block) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Action: Re-peer with the upstream on your public ASN and have them update prefix filters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Detail: After verifying block ownership with the upstream, the transit provider adds your new /22 to their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (inbound prefix list and outbound route map so it is announced to the internet instead of being filtered [Null0) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Labs - Pr9psxw4Z_o @ 00:53:01]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (Start with the unit economics the operators actually paid. Alec Glover ran a thousand GPUs in a warehouse) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (for almost three years at about $25,000 a month, and estimates a typical Tier III facility would have run three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (to five times that, a gap they say saved millions [TZp1yBea0o4 @ 00:00:00]. The math behind it: colocation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (has a hard time pricing below $150 per kilowatt per month, and Glover argues it has only gotten more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (expensive, while every DIY model they ran came in at $50 per kilowatt per month or less, because power) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (that was not used was not paid for [TZp1yBea0o4 @ 00:01:49]. On top of power, IPTP Networks says) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (connectivity is where colo quotes diverge most: every link to another provider or partner needs its own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (cross-connect, carrying an installation fee of typically $500 to $1,500 plus a monthly charge of around $100) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (to $300, so four cross-connects mean $2,000 to $6,000 upfront alone [3EnjHW-36GI @ 00:02:34]. The last) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (recurring line is remote hands, the facility engineers doing reboots, drive swaps, and cable checks on your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (behalf, typically billed at $150 to $350 an hour with a one-hour minimum [3EnjHW-36GI @ 00:02:56].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (Budget every one of these lines before comparing any warehouse lease.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (For small footprints, the street move is to stop buying retail space and share a rack. Techno Tim called) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (several data centers before colocating a homelab: one quoted half a cabinet, 24U, with 50 Mbps burstable to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (a gigabit, two switch ports, and 16 IPs for $900 a month plus a $4,500 one-time fee, and another offered 4U) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (with 50 Mbps burst to 1 gigabit and one public IP for about $350 a month [zbkqRPIUYAo @ 00:00:50]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (workable option came from Will, who runs Plover Digital and rented a whole rack with friends to split the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (cost, which kept dropping as more people joined; Tim recommends that route outright [zbkqRPIUYAo @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (00:01:29]. IPTP Networks explains the structure behind it: top-tier facilities rarely sell less than a full rack, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (1U and partial cabinets typically come through a reseller or managed hosting provider rather than the data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (center itself [3EnjHW-36GI @ 00:00:56]. Some operators do slice inventory directly: Deft, on the Lawrence) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (Systems tour, offers half cabinets and quarter-cabinet compartments to put two customers in the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (physical space, secured with customer-changeable combination locks and optional fingerprint or card) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (readers at the cabinet level [gsN_CJJDy_o @ 00:21:37]. The more tenants on the rack, the lower each) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (share, which is the whole play.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (Network plumbing is where operators cut the most cost with config rather than cash. Alec Glover first NATed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (public IPs to private addresses on machines, then switched to assigning public IPs directly on each server's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (interface, which made wiping a box, re-IPing it, and handing it to the next customer fast [TZp1yBea0o4 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (00:06:26]. When a building cannot get BGP, Null0 Labs builds a plain GRE tunnel from the basement router) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (to a router racked in a provider's data center, skipping IPSec because the tunnel only carries public transit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (then splits the lent /24 into a /25 for the DC LAN and a /30 for the tunnel interfaces [Pr9psxw4Z_o @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (00:17:32]. The session starts on private ASN 64592; the upstream, running public AS900, strips the private) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (ASN, sends only a default route, and filters inbound to the lent /24, so nobody on the internet sees the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (private ASN [Pr9psxw4Z_o @ 00:31:22]. Owning your own ASN is not stifling: Jeremy Cioara shows ARIN's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 84.77 Tm (autonomous system number at a $550 initial fee and $150 a year to maintain, while IPv4 blocks now come) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 69.55 Tm (from a carrier, not ARIN, with authorization to advertise them over BGP [5WW8432TcR4 @ 00:03:15].) Tj ET
