BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (and 3G.20GB profiles and attaching each partition to its own VM, with both VMs seeing the GPU) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm ([4q3LHacRheg @ 00:00:48]. Each camp trades operational weight for a harder boundary: borrowing is light) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (and fast, PR-gated templates leave an audit trail, and VM-attached partitions give the hardest line of the) Tj ET
