BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (unregistered,' yet the avenues keep narrowing. Many direct connect aggregators now refuse unregistered) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (traffic outright because they see it as a liability to their carrier connection [IQ19nUV4NVA @ 00:01:17]. The) Tj ET
