BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (questioned, and that more blocks and more algorithms are coming for unregistered senders. Telgorithm's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (own Q&A lists the enforcement levers carriers pull: pass-through fees of one cent per unregistered message) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (from June 1, filtering, and outright cutoffs [dgkKW0cbz1E @ 00:14:16]. BuzzerBeep gives MSPs the same) Tj ET
