BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (Registry registers brands and campaigns, assigns trust scores, and hands them to carriers. The brand file) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (needs legal name, contact, and industry, while the campaign needs a use case, description, and sample) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (messages [vrVUZ1rSJO0 @ 00:01:56]. RingLogix compresses it further: TCR needs only who is texting and) Tj ET
