BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 534.52 Tm (burn $45. The vetting layer only appeared after cannabis traffic slipped through, back when campaign) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 519.30 Tm (approvals literally took seconds. DCA queues were running 6 to 8 weeks, while Telgorithm claims 3 to 5) Tj ET
