BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Title: Pick a signing path and verify the grade) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Action: Choose fork-to-signer or a proper SBC build, then call the checker number to confirm attestation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Detail: Chris checks the live number against 920-66-1392 and treats anything other than A as a problem to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (fix [Crosstalk Solutions - ycGPHG_ANrE @ 00:04:31].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (Tony Lewis lays out the self-signing bill line by line. The iconectiv token runs thousands a year, priced as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (percentage of 499 revenue with a minimum fee, getting it means clearing a multi-page sandbox test case,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (and the certificate itself costs thousands a year against roughly $100 for SSL [ycGPHG_ANrE @ 00:10:42].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (Tim Lin confirms the governance chain behind those invoices: ATIS is the governance authority, iconectiv is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (the policy administrator that issues tokens and sets an annual fee based on FCC-filed revenue, and multiple) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (certificate authorities are listed by iconectiv [3XJ9OkK8aFw @ 00:05:29]. The cheap path small operators) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (reach for is forking the call to a signing provider, which requires a PJSIP patch plus a first and second trunk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (in FreePBX outbound routes, a setup Chris calls a bubble gum and Band-Aid solution [ycGPHG_ANrE @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (00:12:53]. The proper path Tony describes is a real SBC build with redundancy, geographic failover on both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (coasts, DID, credential, and IP mapping, and 911 caller-ID logic. Against that cost stack, Crosstalk's resale) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (business peaked at 130,000 to 140,000 calls per month and netted only 15 to 20 percent margin every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (month once profitable, while ClearlyIP handles tens of millions [ycGPHG_ANrE @ 00:07:43].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (Rick at ZCorum turns the RMD rule into a repeatable know-your-customer routine. Verify identity, address,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (years in business, and time at that address, then ask what the service is actually for, because a pizza shop) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (is a different risk from a call center or telemarketer [ZLzeR3N0mpc @ 00:07:52]. Terms of service should) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (allow immediate termination on reported abuse, the filer certifies full, partial, or no STIR/SHAKEN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (implementation, and the mitigation plan itself is usually just one page long. The sample WOW plan Rick) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (walks through commits to traceback cooperation, vets businesses on name, physical and mailing address,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (tax ID, phone, email, and PIN, and blocks unassigned numbers, with an FCC Registration Number required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (to file [ZLzeR3N0mpc @ 00:13:22]. Tim Lin layers on the carrier-side obligations: cooperate with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (Industry Traceback Group and law enforcement, and expect calls from providers without a certificate on file) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (to be refused from September 28, 2021 [3XJ9OkK8aFw @ 00:15:13]. Lin's routing rule is blunt: sign your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (own calls if you are multi-vendor or an outbound contact center, otherwise you face caller-ID-based routing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (On the foreign side, Chris and Tony Lewis say carriers handling foreign gateway traffic face a binary choice,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (know your customer or block [ycGPHG_ANrE @ 00:25:56].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (On the wireless and eSIM side the mechanics are platform-driven. Brian Lachford says MVNOs otherwise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (juggle three to six vendors, launches that once took six months with a one-week port now port in minutes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (and Atomic Mobile hands out a free 100-item launch checklist with no signup [Gye5g8KT7Oo @ 00:13:33].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (Lachford flags real-time usage as the margin lever: lags of 3, 6, or 9 hours make usage plans risky, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (Atomic hired Amanda Herman, 22 years at AT&T, to fix it for margins, fraud, and spam control) Tj ET
